sequenceDiagram
  participant F as Fulfilment
  participant S as LockerService
  participant R as LockerRepository
  participant C as Carrier
  participant Cu as Customer
  F->>S: assignLockers(order)
  S->>R: book(locker) — atomic
  S-->>F: locker BOOKED
  C->>S: deliver(package)
  S->>S: issue 6-digit code, valid 3 days
  S-->>Cu: email: locker + code
